      "_src": "floors 2-5, icon__south-elevation__02.jpg (Rhode Partners' photograph, frontal) and the owner's dusk aerial, 2026-09-16: a bolder white grid, a proud white pier on EVERY bay line and a white band at every floor; one big ~1.55 x 1.8 m window per bay under a taupe head, and beside it on the left a ~0.5 m panel in one of seven colours, picked per bay and storey (and sometimes plain white). The panel stands on the viewer's LEFT of the window; this face's s runs right-to-left seen from outside, so the file says 'right'. It runs the whole storey between the white bands (2026-09-17, street photo)."
